sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 使用者
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant E as ChatTurnEngine
    participant R as AgentRunner
    participant T as 工具 (exec / read_file / ask_kb)

    U->>API: POST 訊息
    API->>API: 存進 Conversation
    API->>API: 解析 AgentConfig (app ◇ profile ◇ preset)
    API->>E: stream(key, content, ctx)
    E->>E: 取消同一 key 前一個還在跑的回合
    E->>R: run(ctx)
    loop 串流事件
        R->>T: 呼叫工具
        T-->>E: ToolLog (stdout 邊跑邊回)
        R-->>E: 推理 / 訊息 / 用量
        E-->>U: SSE 事件
    end
    E->>API: on_complete → 存回 Conversation
